OL,3,GNEWSAFormer MHK questions integrity of
OL,4,Aelection results
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe outcome of a recount of ballot
OL,7,Fpapers cast in a Manx constituency
OL,8,Fsuggests the integrity of this year's
OL,9,Fgeneral election is "questionable", a
OL,10,Fformer MHK has said.
OL,12,FFollowing a supervised count, the
OL,13,Fnumber of votes changed for five of the
OL,14,Fsix candidates who stood in Onchan in
OL,15,FSeptember.
OL,17,FThe recount was carried out following a
OL,18,Fpetition by Julie Edge, who lost her
OL,19,FHouse of Keys seat. She said the
OL,20,Fchanged vote totals proved there was a
OL,21,Fneed for a review of the election count
OL,22,Fprocess.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,449,445,260,140,0,100
